=== effective-basin count from pooled J*M SMC samples (lam05, l=0.368) ===
sim = (q_box - bulk)/(rho - bulk); ceiling rho=1.149, bulk=0.057
   R N_pool |  CC@0.4  CC@0.6  CC@0.8 |    PR | n_distinct(RMSD) | qc_pair
 1.6     96 |    10.6    14.0    37.0 |   9.7 |             31.4 | 0.143
